    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** Under Offer** Sherry Fitzgerald Stack are delighted to present this impressive 4 bedroom, 4 bathroom detached residence to the market. Offering an exceptional blend of contemporary style, comfort and energy efficiency, this beautifully finished A3-rated home is presented in turnkey condition and is ready for immediate occupation. \nDesigned with modern family living in mind, the bright and spacious accommodation is beautifully proportioned and complimented with quality fixtures and fittings throughout. The double height entrance hallway leads to a generous living room and an impressive open-plan kitchen/dining area, complete with a walk-in pantry and utility room. A spacious lounge, ground-floor double bedroom with ensuite and a guest WC complete the ground floor accommodation.\nUpstairs, the property has a spacious open landing and offers 3 generously sized double bedrooms (one ensuite, two with walk in wardrobes) together with a stylish family bathroom.\nThe exterior is equally impressive. Set on an elevated 0.49 acre approx. site with superb views of the surrounding countryside, the beautifully landscaped gardens can be accessed directly from the kitchen/dining area via French doors, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living. The gardens feature mature lawns, shrubs, hedging and raised beds. A tarmacadam driveway offers ample space, while the former commercial garage provides excellent storage, workshop or hobby space. A separate fuel store adds further practicality, and the included Husqvarna Automower ensures effortless lawn maintenance.\nCombining spacious accommodation, exceptional finishes and superb energy efficiency, this outstanding property offers a rare opportunity to acquire a truly turnkey family home.\nThis exceptional property must be viewed to be fully appreciated - viewing strictly by appointment only with Sherry Fitzgerald Stack."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 4.53m x 2.42m\nwith wooden flooring, double height ceiling & 2 Velux windows providing an abundance of natural light\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 4.69m x 4.62m\nwith Stanley solid fuel insert stove with black fireplace surround and hearth, wooden flooring, coving detail, 2 windows (1 bay)\n\nKitchen / Dining / Living Room - 7.09m x 4.30m\ngrey modern fitted kitchen with integrated fridge and dishwasher, induction hob in island with pendant lights, chrome light fittings, glazed wall tiles, wooden flooring & 3 windows\n\nLiving Room - 3.94m x 3.19m\nsolid fuel stove (with back boiler), wooden flooring, 2 windows and french doors leading out onto paved patio & decking area complete with beautifully landscaped gardens\n\nUtility Room - 3.02m x 2.40m\nWashing Machine and Dryer, fitted units, sink, wall & floor tiles, window and half glazed door to side\n\nPantry - 2.70m x 1.48m\nfloor tiles, shelved\n\nW/C - 2.99m x 0.93m\nModern w/c with black shower door enclosure with matching black LED mirror, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nHallway Closet - 1.09m x 0.59m\n\n\nDownstairs Bedroom - 3.73m x 3.31m\ndouble with wooden flooring & bay window\n\nEnsuite - 2.99m x 1.10\nelectric shower, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nLanding - 4.82m x 3.92m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 (Master) - 5.92m x 5.99m\ndouble with carpet flooring & 2 windows\n\nEnsuite - 2.45m x 2.14m\nAqualisa Aquastream shower, LED mirror, wall & floor tiles, vanity unit, w/c & velux window\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.45m x 2.14m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.63m x 3.95m\ndouble with wooden flooring & window\n\nBedroom 4 - 5.36m x 3.13m\ndouble with carpet flooring & window, access to Attic\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 1.89m x 1.82m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nOutbuildings - \n\n\nDetached Garage - 9.29m x 6.24m\nwith roller door, 2 windows, high ceiling (roof recently replaced), electricity connected (previously a commercial garage)\n\nFuel Store - 3.86m x 3.38m\npedestrian door with electricity connected\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4 bedroom, 4 bathroom detached A3 energy efficient home </li><li>Set on a 0.49 acre site fully landscaped site </li><li>Stunning views of the surrounding countryside from its elevated position </li><li>Designed with sustainability in mind: 21 solar panels fitted, a Dyness 9kW battery storage system with changeover switch, helping to maximise energy efficiency and reduce running costs</li><li>Previously a commercial garage with its own entrance</li><li>Seperate fuel store</li><li>Husvarna Autmower and Applicances included </li><li>Fibre broadband is available - ideal home for remote working or modern family life.</li><li>Two recently renovated bathrooms add a contemporary touch</li><li>Oil fired central heating, mains water and on site septic tank</li><li>Double glazed windows fitted throughout </li><li>Mature lawns, hedging, shrubbery and raised beds </li><li>Raised patio off the kitchen / living room - ideal space for outdoor entertaining </li><li>Tarmacadam driveway</ul>"
      },
